<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Charter details scrip dividend alternative.</title>
<headline>Charter details scrip dividend alternative.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Charter Plc said on Thursday the price of the shares to be offered to shareholders under the gross scrip dividend alternative to the 1996 interim dividend was 841 pence a share.</p>
<p>Shareholders would accordingly receive 13 shares for every 1,000 shares held at the record date, Charter said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
